    noticeAudioBody: "On a PC, you can adjust the volume from “MENU” at the top right of the screen. On a smartphone, please adjust the volume using your device settings.",

    noticeTitle: "About this experience",

    noticeItem1: "This is a game. Your experience while playing differs from reality.",
    noticeItem2: "You are free to start or stop the game at any time.",
    noticeItem3: "Your participation in the game and its outcomes will not affect your individual evaluation.",
    noticeItem4: "Estimated play time is approximately 30 minutes. Please make sure you have enough time to complete the experience.",
    noticeItem5: "If you feel uncomfortable during play, you may stop the game at any time.",
    noticeItem6: "Even if you stop partway through, you can resume at any time from “CONTINUE” on the title screen.",
    
    noticeButton: "I UNDERSTAND",

    // --------------------------------------------------------
    // 0. Opening
    // --------------------------------------------------------

    "g00.l001": "Something... I can hear something.",
    "g00.l002": "Crying? It sounds like a cat...",
    "g00.l003": "No—it's a child's voice.",

    "g00.c001": "Open your eyes",
    "g00.c002": "Don't open your eyes",

    "g00.ui001": "Please choose one.",

    "g00.l004": "...Where... am I?",
    "g00.l005a": "The moment I open my eyes,",
    "g00.l005b": "I notice something cold",
    "g00.l005c": "clinging to my skin.",

    "g00.l006a": "I catch the scent of soil",
    "g00.l006b": "and damp wood.",

    "g00.l007a": "My own breathing and heartbeat",
    "g00.l007b": "sound strangely loud,",

    "g00.l008a": "even though everything is so quiet,",
    "g00.l008b": "it feels deafening.",

    "g00.l009": "...",
    "g00.l010": "......",

    "g01.l001": "Why am I in a place like this?",
    "g01.l002a": "I'm sure I was asleep",
    "g01.l002b": "just a moment ago...",
    "g01.l003": "So is this... a dream?",
    "g01.l004a": "For now,",
    "g01.l004b": "I look around.",
    "g01.l005": "...There it is again.",

    "g01.c001": "Walk toward the voice",
    "g01.c002": "Stay where you are",

    // Additional display text
    "g01.l006a": "I push through the fog",
    "g01.l006b": "and start walking toward the voice.",
    "g01.l007a": "Walking through this blindness feels dangerous,",
    "g01.l007b": "and I'm scared.",
    "g01.l008": "...But.",
    "g01.l009a": "It feels like nothing will",
    "g01.l009b": "change if I just stand here.",
    "g01.l010a": "I make up my mind",
    "g02.l001a": "Between the darkness and the thick fog,",
    "g02.l001b": "I can't tell where I'm walking.",
    "g02.l002a": "But little by little,",
    "g02.l002b": "the voice grows closer—",
    "g02.l003": "Beyond the fog, I see a small shape.",
    "g02.l004a": "Huddled against the roots of a tree,",
    "g02.l004b": "knees pulled in—it's a child.",
    "g02.c001": "Call out to them",
    "g02.c002": "Don't call out",
    "g02.l005": "Are you okay?",
    "g02.l006a": "I speak to their back, and they flinch,",
    "g02.l006b": "their shoulders rising slightly, as if startled.",
    "g02.l007": "\"Uh... sniff...\"",
    "g02.l008a": "They turn around,",
    "g02.l008b": "and though it's too dark to see clearly,",
    "g02.l008c": "I can tell their cheeks are soaked with tears.",
    "g03.l001": "\"...Sniff... hic...\"",
    "g03.l002a": "I spoke to them,",
    "g03.l002b": "but all I can do is watch as they cry,",
    "g03.l002c": "not knowing how to help.",
    "g03.c001": "Are you lost?",
    "g03.l003a": "I don't even know where I am myself,",
    "g03.l003b": "so it feels like a strange question, but I ask anyway.",
    "g03.l004": "\"...I lost it...\"",
    "g03.l005": "The child murmurs this, their words catching.",
    "g03.c002": "Lost what?",
    "g03.l006": "You lost something—what was it?",
    "g03.l007": "\"...I don't know.\"",
    "g03.l008": "What?",
    "g03.l009a": "\"What do I do...",
    "g03.l009b": "I lost it... uhh...\"",
    "g03.l010a": "They're crying over losing something,",
    "g03.l010b": "even though they don't know what it was?",
    "g03.l011": "\"Uhh... sniff... hic...\"",
    "g03.l012a": "I don't know what to do,",
    "g03.l012b": "and I start to feel like crying too.",
    "g03.c003": "Where's your family?",
    "g03.l013": "Where is your family?",
    "g03.l014": "\"...I don't know.\"",
    "g03.l015a": "\"Maybe they were here.",
    "g03.l015b": "...But right now, I'm all alone.\"",
    "g03.l016": "I see...",
    "g03.l017": "I'm alone too, just like them.",
    "g03.l018a": "\"I lost it...",
    "g03.l018b": "it's gone... sniff...\"",
    "g03.l019a": "Strangely,",
    "g03.l019b": "seeing someone more troubled than me",
    "g03.l019c": "makes my own anxiety feel smaller.",
    "g03.l020": "I want to do something to help.",
    "g03.c004": "Search together",
    "g03.c005": "Is there anything I can do?",
    "g03.l021": "Let's look for what you lost together.",
    "g03.l022": "\"...Really?\"",
    "g03.l023": "Is there something I can do?",
    "g03.l024": "\".........\"",
    "g03.l025": "\"...I want you to look with me.\"",
    "g03.l026": "Okay, let's look together.",
    "g03.l027a": "Their tear-soaked eyes",
    "g03.l027b": "open wide and sparkle.",
    "g03.l028": "I nod firmly,",
    "g03.l029": "\"Wow... yay!\"",
    "g03.l030a": "A bright, bouncing voice",
    "g03.l030b": "rings out through the fog.",
    "g03.l031a": "Their tears stop instantly,",
    "g03.l031b": "and they laugh, bright and happy.",
    "g03.l032": "I'm glad I said it.",
    "g03.l033": "\"Hehe.\"",
    "g03.l034a": "They must be really happy—",
    "g03.l034b": "they lean their body against mine.",
    "g03.l035a": "Where we touch feels warm,",
    "g03.l035b": "and somehow it puts me at ease.",
    "g03.l036": "\"Mm.\"",
    "g03.l037a": "They take my hand,",
    "g03.l037b": "their small fingers wrapping around mine.",
    "g03.c006": "Hold their hand back",
    "g03.c007": "Leave it as it is",
    "g03.l038a": "I squeeze their small hand back firmly,",
    "g03.l038b": "as if to say we're in this together now,",
    "g03.l039": "\"Hehehe!\"",
    "g03.l040a": "They laugh brightly,",
    "g03.l040b": "as if the crying from just moments ago",
    "g03.l040c": "never happened.",
    "g03.l041a": "They must have felt so alone.",
    "g03.l041b": "I leave my fingers as they are, held in theirs.",
    "g04.l001": "\"Hey, what should I call you?\"",
    "g04.l002a": "Still holding my hand,",
    "g04.l002b": "they hop up and down and ask, looking happy.",
    "g04.l003": "What do I want to be called...",
    "g04.l004a": "\"Huh, you still haven't told me.",
    "g04.l004b": "What should I call you?\"",
    "g04.c001": "\"{value}\" works for me",
    "g04.l005": "Will you call me {value}?",
    "g04.l006": "\"Is it okay if I call you {value}?\"",
    "g04.c002": "Actually, let me change it",
    "g04.l007": "Sure, nice to meet you.",
    "g04.l008": "\"Nice to meet you, {value}!\"",
    "g04.l009": "Let me change it after all.",
    "g05.l001a": "I squint",
    "g05.l001b": "into the thick fog ahead.",
    "g05.l002a": "I have no idea",
    "g05.l002b": "what lies beyond it.",
    "g05.l003a": "But staying here won't help",
    "g05.l003b": "find what this child lost.",
    "g05.l004a": "For now,",
    "g05.l004b": "let's find a way out of here.",
    "g05.l005a": "...Come to think of it,",
    "g05.l005b": "where did this child come from?",
    "g05.c001": "Where did you come from?",
    "g05.c002": "Do you remember the way you came?",
    "g05.l006": "Where did you come from?",
    "g05.l007a": "I ask,",
    "g05.l007b": "and they tilt their head up, looking puzzled.",
    "g05.l008": "\"...Where...?\"",
    "g05.l009a": "\"I don't know.",
    "g05.l009b": "Where was it?\"",
    "g05.l010": "...I see.",
    "g05.l011": "\"...The way...?\"",
    "g05.l012a": "Do you remember",
    "g05.l012b": "what kind of path you took to get here?",
    "g05.l013a": "\"No, I don't know.",
    "g05.l014": "In that case, we'll just have to search together.",
    "g05.c003": "Let's explore",
    "g05.c004": "Let's just walk",
    "g05.l015": "Let's explore together.",
    "g05.l016": "\"Okay! An adventure!\"",
    "g05.l017a": "The word seems to excite them—",
    "g05.l017b": "they smile brightly",
    "g05.l017c": "and grip my hand tighter.",
    "g05.l018a": "Relieved by their reaction,",
    "g05.l018b": "we start walking, hand in hand.",
    "g05.l019": "Shall we walk together?",
    "g05.l020": "\"Okay.\"",
    "g05.l021a": "Hearing their answer,",
    "g05.l022a": "The two of us",
    "g05.l022b": "walk slowly through the fog.",
    "g05.l023a": "Now and then, I feel",
    "g05.l023b": "grass brushing against my shins.",
    "g05.l024a": "Maybe this isn't",
    "g05.l024b": "a path meant for people",
    "g05.l024c": "to walk at all.",
    "g05.l025a": "If we keep walking like this,",
    "g05.l025b": "where will we end up?",
    "g05.l026a": "The dampness clinging to my skin",
    "g05.l026b": "makes me even more anxious,",
    "g05.l027a": "and even though I don't feel hot,",
    "g05.l027b": "sweat slowly beads on my forehead.",
    "g05.l028a": "Afraid my anxiety might show,",
    "g05.l028b": "I gently let go of their hand.",
    "g05.l029": "\"...Are you okay?\"",
    "g05.l030a": "They peer at my face,",
    "g05.l030b": "looking worried—even though just a moment ago,",
    "g05.l030c": "they were the one who seemed unbearably anxious.",
    "g05.l031a": "I want to say I'm not okay,",
    "g05.l031b": "but I don't want to see that crying face again.",
    "g05.l032": "But I can't quite say I'm okay either.",
    "g05.l033": "While I stay silent, unable to answer,",
    "g05.l034": "\"I wonder if we won't find it...\"",
    "g05.l035a": "A small murmur",
    "g05.l035b": "echoes through the fog.",
    "g05.l036a": "At the very least, I want",
    "g05.l036b": "to ease this child's worry, even a little.",
    "g05.c005": "Still can't remember?",
    "g05.c006": "Did something come back to you?",
    "g05.l037a": "Can you still not remember",
    "g05.l037b": "what you lost?",
    "g05.l038": "\"...Yeah.\"",
    "g05.l039a": "Did you remember",
    "g05.l039b": "what you lost?",
    "g05.l040": "\"...No.\"",
    "g05.l041": "Is there any hint you can think of?",
    "g05.l042": "\"A hint?\"",
    "g05.l043a": "Like... its size, maybe,",
    "g05.l043b": "or its color, shape, or smell...",
    "g05.l044a": "Whether someone gave it to you,",
    "g05.l044b": "or you bought it yourself.",
    "g05.l045": "\".............\"",
    "g05.l046a": "I watch them think it over,",
    "g05.l046b": "almost as if I'm praying for an answer.",
    "g05.l047a": "If we can at least find what this child is looking for,",
    "g05.l047b": "I feel like it might lighten things, even a little.",
    "g05.l048": "\"Something I don't want to lose.\"",
    "g05.l049": "Is that the only hint?",
    "g05.l050a": "\"Hey,",
    "g05.l050b": "what's something you don't want to lose, {value}?\"",
    "g05.l051": "Something I don't want to lose?",
    "g05.l052a": "\"Yeah.",
    "g05.l052b": "Maybe it's the same kind of thing.\"",
    "g05.l053": "...I see.",
    "g05.l054a": "I'm not sure if it'll help,",
    "g05.l054b": "but let's think about it.",
    "g05.l055a": "Something I don't want to lose. ...So,",
    "g05.l055b": "something that would be a problem to lose?",
    "g05.c007": "Money",
    "g05.c008": "Student ID",
    "g05.c009": "Phone",
    "g05.l056": "Maybe money.",
    "g05.l057": "\"Nope.\"",
    "g05.l058a": "Instant answer.",
    "g05.l058b": "It makes me feel a little bad, somehow.",
    "g05.l059a": "Maybe my student ID.",
    "g05.l059b": "It proves who I am.",
    "g05.l060": "\"Hmm, I don't think so.\"",
    "g05.l061": "If it's not that, then...",
    "g05.l062a": "Maybe my phone.",
    "g05.l062b": "Everything I need is in there.",
    "g05.l063": "\"It's not something like that...\"",
    "g05.l064": "...What could it be?",
    "g05.l065a": "Something I don't want to lose more than money,",
    "g05.l065b": "my student ID, or my phone.",
    "g05.l066a": "Something that would make me feel",
    "g05.l066b": "that sad if I lost it...",
    "g05.l067a": "I remember that crying",
    "g05.l067b": "I heard before I opened my eyes.",
    "g05.l068a": "\"...I think it was...",
    "g05.l068b": "something that can't be replaced.\"",
    "g05.l069": "—Something irreplaceable.",
    "g05.l070a": "So it means something that has no substitute,",
    "g05.l070b": "nothing else that could take its place.",
    "g05.l071a": "True, losing money would be a problem,",
    "g05.l071b": "but there's always a way to get more.",
    "g05.l072a": "A student ID can be reissued",
    "g05.l072b": "if I apply at the registrar's office.",
    "g05.l073a": "Even a phone can have",
    "g05.l073b": "its contents restored if it's backed up.",
    "g05.l074a": "—So what's really",
    "g05.l074b": "something",
    "g05.l074c": "that has no replacement?",
    "g05.l075": "\"...What could it be?\"",
    "g05.l076a": "They ask at just the moment",
    "g05.l076b": "it feels like they're reading my mind.",
    "g05.c010": "Let's think about it together",
    "g05.c011": "I can't think of anything",
    "g05.l077": "Let's try thinking about it together.",
    "g05.l078": "\"Okay!\"",
    "g05.l079": "For example......",
    "g05.l080": "I can't think of anything...",
    "g05.l081": "\"Then let's think about it together.\"",
    "g05.l082a": "Maybe the two of us can figure it out together.",
    "g05.l082b": "I nod firmly at those words.",
    "g05.l083": "\"For example...\"",
    "g05.l084a": "Slowly, we each start naming",
    "g05.l084b": "things that come to mind.",
    "g05.c012": "Someone important",
    "g05.c013": "A gift",
    "g05.c014": "Words",
    "g05.c015": "A treasure",
    "g05.c016": "A goal",
    "g05.c017": "A place full of memories",
    "g05.l085a": "Thanks to thinking it through together,",
    "g05.l085b": "all kinds of things come to mind.",
    "g05.l086a": "\"I see...",
    "g05.l086b": "maybe that's it.\"",
    "g05.l087a": "Beside me,",
    "g05.l087b": "they murmur softly, eyes wide.",
    "g05.l088": "Does something feel like it's coming back to you?",
    "g05.l089a": "\"...Hey,",
    "g05.l089b": "is the thing you don't want to lose",
    "g05.l089c": "somewhere in here, {value}?\"",
    "g05.l090a": "—Something",
    "g05.l090b": "I don't want to lose...",
    "g05.l091a": "\"Someone you don't want to lose.",
    "g05.l091b": "A gift you don't want to lose...",
    "g05.l091c": "or words you don't want to lose.\"",
    "g05.l092": "That's true...",
    "g05.c018": "Yes, there is",
    "g05.c019": "Maybe there is",
    "g05.l093": "There is.",
    "g05.l094": "\"Really?\"",
    "g05.l095a": "I answer,",
    "g05.l095b": "and their eyes light up.",
    "g05.l096a": "\"Hey, tell me more!",
    "g05.l096b": "About the thing you don't want to lose,",
    "g05.l096c": "{value}!\"",
    "g05.l097a": "They grip my hand tightly and tug,",
    "g05.l097b": "shaking it as if pulling me along.",
    "g05.l098": "Maybe... there is something.",
    "g05.l099": "\"Maybe...?\"",
    "g05.l100b": "and their voice trembles with worry.",
    "g05.l101a": "Hmm...",
    "g05.l101b": "when they react like that...",
    "g05.c020": "I'm starting to think there is",
    "g05.l102": "...I'm starting to think there is.",
    "g06.l001a": "\"Pick one",
    "g06.l001b": "from these, okay?\"",
    "g06.l002a": "There's someone important",
    "g06.l002b": "I don't want to lose.",
    "g06.l003a": "\"What's this important",
    "g06.l003b": "person like, {value}?\"",
    "g06.l004": "What are they like...",
    "g06.l005a": "I picture their face,",
    "g06.l005b": "and the time we spent",
    "g06.l005c": "together.",
    "g06.l006a": "There's another",
    "g06.l006b": "important person, too.",
    "g06.l007a": "\"There's someone else too?",
    "g06.l007b": "Amazing! Tell me about them!\"",
    "g06.l008a": "There's a gift",
    "g06.l008b": "I don't want to lose.",
    "g06.l009a": "\"What kind of gift?",
    "g06.l009b": "Who gave it to you?\"",
    "g06.l010": "What kind of thing...",
    "g06.l011a": "I think about the person who gave it to me,",
    "g06.l011b": "and why I don't want to lose it.",
    "g06.l012a": "There's another",
    "g06.l012b": "important gift, too.",
    "g06.l013a": "\"There's another one too? Amazing!",
    "g06.l013b": "Tell me about that gift!\"",
    "g06.l014a": "There are words",
    "g06.l014b": "I don't want to lose.",
    "g06.l015a": "\"What words?",
    "g06.l015b": "Did you find them somewhere,",
    "g06.l015c": "or did someone say them to you?\"",
    "g06.l016": "What words were they...",
    "g06.l017a": "I recall the words and",
    "g06.l017b": "think about why they're so special.",
    "g06.l018a": "There are other",
    "g06.l018b": "important words, too.",
    "g06.l019a": "\"There's more too? Amazing!",
    "g06.l019b": "Tell me about those words!\"",
    "g06.l020a": "I have a treasure",
    "g06.l020b": "I don't want to lose.",
    "g06.l021a": "\"What kind of treasure?",
    "g06.l021b": "How did you find it?\"",
    "g06.l022a": "I think about how",
    "g06.l022b": "to explain why it's",
    "g06.l022c": "such a treasure to me.",
    "g06.l023b": "treasure, too.",
    "g06.l024b": "Tell me about that treasure!\"",
    "g06.l025a": "I have a goal",
    "g06.l025b": "I don't want to lose.",
    "g06.l026a": "\"What kind of goal?",
    "g06.l026b": "Since when?",
    "g06.l026c": "How did it come about?\"",
    "g06.l027": "What kind of goal...",
    "g06.l028a": "I try to remember",
    "g06.l028b": "when and how",
    "g06.l028c": "this goal came to be.",
    "g06.l029b": "important goal, too.",
    "g06.l030b": "Tell me about that goal!\"",
    "g06.l031a": "There's a place full of memories",
    "g06.l031b": "I don't want to lose.",
    "g06.l032a": "\"What kind of place?",
    "g06.l032b": "What memories do you have there?\"",
    "g06.l033": "Memories of that place...",
    "g06.l034a": "I think about how I spent time there,",
    "g06.l034b": "and what memories I have.",
    "g06.l035b": "important place, too.",
    "g06.l036b": "Tell me about that place!\"",
    "g06.l037a": "\"Anything at all is fine—",
    "g06.l037b": "I'd love to hear about it.\"",
    "g06.l038a": "They stare at me intently,",
    "g06.l038b": "as if they can hardly wait.",
    "g06.l039a": "I wonder if I can put it into words.",
    "g06.l039b": "—But let's try.",
    "g06.l040a": "\"If there's anything else,",
    "g06.l040b": "I'd love to hear it.\"",
    "g06.ui001": "Write here",
    "g06.l041a": "\"{value}",
    "g06.l041b": "...\"",
    "g06.l042": "\"...I see.\"",
    "g06.l043": "\"Thank you for telling me.\"",
    "g06.l044a": "Just as they smile,",
    "g06.l044b": "looking satisfied—",
    "g06.l045": "...Huh?",
    "g06.l046a": "I notice the area",
    "g06.l046b": "has grown faintly brighter.",
    "g06.l047a": "Maybe my eyes have just",
    "g06.l047b": "gotten used to the dark.",
    "g06.l048a": "\"Hey, {value},",
    "g06.l048b": "is there anything else",
    "g06.l048c": "you don't want to lose?\"",
    "g06.c001": "I'd like to talk a little more",
    "g06.c002": "I can't think of anything else",
    "g06.l049": "...I guess I can't think of anything else.",
    "g06.l050": "\"I see. Thank you.\"",
    "g06.l051a": "—About the things",
    "g06.l051b": "I don't want to lose.",
    "g06.l052a": "While thinking it over,",
    "g06.l052b": "I realize the scenery",
    "g06.l052c": "around me has changed.",
    "g06.l053a": "When I first opened my eyes,",
    "g06.l053b": "it was pitch black, surrounded by fog,",
    "g06.l053c": "with only this child's crying to be heard.",
    "g06.l054": "I was so anxious.",
    "g06.l055": "But now—",
    "g06.l056": "\"I like it here.\"",
    "g06.l057a": "Beside me, they look around",
    "g06.l057b": "with a face full of genuine relief,",
    "g06.l057c": "and it makes that fear feel like it happened long ago.",
    "g06.l058": "\"...Somehow, I feel at ease.\"",
    "g06.l059": "I give a small nod at those words,",
    "g06.l060a": "\"Do you like it here too,",
    "g06.l060b": "{value}?\"",
    "g06.l061": "Asked this, I stop to think.",
    "g07.c001": "I like it",
    "g07.c002": "It's not bad",
    "g07.c003": "I want to like it more",
    "g07.l001": "I guess... I like it.",
    "g07.l002a": "They smile bashfully, looking happy,",
    "g07.l002b": "as if the words were meant for them too.",
    "g07.l003": "\"I'm so glad.\"",
    "g07.l004": "I guess it's not bad.",
    "g07.l005a": "\"I see.",
    "g07.l005b": "Not bad, not bad.\"",
    "g07.l006a": "They nod, satisfied,",
    "g07.l006b": "murmuring those words over and over.",
    "g07.l007": "Right now, not really, so much...",
    "g07.l008a": "So I want to like it",
    "g07.l008b": "more than I do now.",
    "g07.l009b": "I like that.\"",
    "g07.l010a": "They blink, a little surprised,",
    "g07.l010b": "then smile warmly.",
    "g08.l001a": "\"You really know",
    "g08.l001b": "what you don't want to lose,",
    "g08.l001c": "{value}.\"",
    "g08.l002a": "\"I think that's enough,",
    "g08.l002b": "all by itself.\"",
    "g08.l003": "...I wonder if that's true.",
    "g08.l004a": "Before I know it,",
    "g08.l004b": "I see a break in the fog at my feet.",
    "g09.l001": "\"I want to stay here forever.\"",
    "g09.l002a": "They say this and",
    "g09.l002b": "flop down onto the grass.",
    "g09.l003a": "\"Don't you need to go look",
    "g09.l003b": "for what you lost?\"",
    "g09.l004": "I crouch down beside them and ask.",
    "g09.l005": "\"I found it.\"",
    "g09.l006a": "\"Everything I thought I'd lost—",
    "g09.l006b": "it was all here.\"",
    "g09.l007": "—Here.",
    "g09.l008a": "At first, it was wrapped in fog",
    "g09.l008b": "so thick I could barely see anything.",
    "g09.l009a": "But little by little it cleared,",
    "g09.l009b": "and somehow this place",
    "g09.l009c": "came to feel safe.",
    "g09.l010a": "\"Thank you for",
    "g09.l010b": "making this place.\"",
    "g09.l011a": "They sit up and turn to face me,",
    "g09.l011b": "murmuring those words.",
    "g09.l012": "Made it...?",
    "g09.l013a": "\"You told me about",
    "g09.l013b": "\"{value}\"",
    "g09.l013c": "remember?\"",
    "g09.l014a": "\"And",
    "g09.l014b": "\"{value}\" too.\"",
    "g09.l016a": "\"Ever since then,",
    "g09.l016b": "it's been getting brighter, little by little.\"",
    "g09.l017a": "—Come to think of it,",
    "g09.l017b": "the moments the area grew brighter",
    "g09.l018a": "were always when I thought of something",
    "g09.l018b": "I didn't want to lose and told this child about it.",
    "g09.l019": "Then...",
    "g09.l020a": "This forest, this scenery—",
    "g09.l020b": "it's made of the things",
    "g09.l020c": "I don't want to lose.",
    "g09.l021a": "It's made from my feelings for",
    "g09.l021b": "the things I don't want to lose.",
    "g09.l022": "—Is it okay to understand it that way?",
    "g09.l023a": "\"I thought everything was gone,",
    "g09.l023b": "but it wasn't, after all.\"",
    "g09.l024a": "The small hand gently",
    "g09.l024b": "takes my fingers again.",
    "g09.l025a": "\"I was happy",
    "g09.l025b": "you walked with me.\"",
    "g09.l026": "In that moment—",
    "g09.l027a": "A wind blows through from somewhere,",
    "g09.l027b": "and blindingly bright morning light",
    "g09.l027c": "begins to fill the forest.",
    "g09.l028a": "Startled, I look around,",
    "g09.l028b": "and my hand is gripped firmly,",
    "g09.l028c": "as if to reassure me.",
    "g09.l029a": "The hand I was holding until just now",
    "g09.l029b": "was small, soft, and warm.",
    "g09.l030a": "But the hand I'm holding now is dry,",
    "g09.l030b": "bony, and a little cold.",
    "g09.l031a": "I look toward the hand holding mine,",
    "g09.l031b": "but maybe because of the light,",
    "g09.l031c": "I can't quite make out their face.",
    "g09.l032a": "\"When 'that time' comes,",
    "g09.l032b": "you lose the things",
    "g09.l032c": "that matter most.\"",
    "g09.l033a": "The voice I hear is hoarse,",
    "g09.l033b": "and trembling slightly.",
    "g09.l034a": "Who is",
    "g09.l034b": "this person?",
    "g09.l035a": "\"So it felt like",
    "g09.l035b": "I had nothing at all.\"",
    "g09.l036": "\"I was lonely, and scared.\"",
    "g09.l037": "\"—But that wasn't true.\"",
    "g09.l038a": "\"There really was something",
    "g09.l038b": "I didn't want to lose.\"",
    "g09.l039a": "\"I really did",
    "g09.l039b": "care about that person.\"",
    "g09.l040a": "\"I really did",
    "g09.l040b": "treasure that gift.\"",
    "g09.l041a": "\"Those words",
    "g09.l041b": "really did stay with me.\"",
    "g09.l042a": "\"I really did",
    "g09.l042b": "cherish that treasure.\"",
    "g09.l043a": "\"I really did have a goal,",
    "g09.l043b": "and kept moving toward it.\"",
    "g09.l044a": "\"There really was a place",
    "g09.l044b": "I wanted to return to.\"",
    "g09.l045": "\"...Thank you for helping me remember.\"",
    "g09.l046a": "As the voice fades,",
    "g09.l046b": "the feeling of the hand I was holding disappears.",
    "g09.l047a": "I look for where they went,",
    "g09.l047b": "but somehow, I already know.",
    "g09.l048a": "I'm the only one",
    "g09.l048b": "here.",
    "g09.l049": "...",
    "g09.l050": "......No, that's not right.",
    "g09.l051a": "Come to think of it,",
    "g09.l051b": "maybe I was always alone here, from the very start.",
    "g10.l001a": "The question I was asked before",
    "g10.l001b": "echoes in my mind once more.",
    "g10.l002a": "\"Do you like yourself,",
    "g10.l002b": "{value}?\"",
    "g10.c001": "I like myself",
    "g10.c002": "I'm not bad",
    "g10.c003": "I want to like myself more",
    "g10.l003": "I guess... I do like myself.",
    "g10.l004": "I think that's probably true.",
    "g10.l005": "I guess I'm not bad.",
    "g10.l006a": "I might not say I like myself,",
    "g10.l006b": "but I don't dislike myself either.",
    "g10.l007a": "So I want to like myself",
    "g10.l008a": "Before I know it,",
    "g10.l008b": "the fog is gone completely.",
    "g10.l009a": "Soft morning light filters through",
    "g10.l009b": "the gaps between the trees.",
    "g10.l010a": "At my feet,",
    "g10.l010b": "several small flowers have bloomed.",
    "g10.l011a": "As if I'm being told,",
    "g10.l011b": "\"You can leave this place now.\"",
    "g10.l012a": "It's okay.",
    "g10.l012b": "I can go home now.",
    "g10.l013a": "I close my eyes",
    "g10.l013b": "and take a deep breath.",
    "g10.l014a": "When I open my eyes again,",
    "g10.l014b": "I see the familiar ceiling.",
    "g10.l015a": "The fog,",
    "g10.l015b": "and the child's voice—",
    "g10.l015c": "none of it remains.",
    "g10.ui001": "\"",
    "g10.ui002": "\"",
    "g10.l016a": "These were the things that mattered.",
    "g10.l016b": "I remembered them clearly.",
    "g10.l017a": "—Now,",
    "g10.l017b": "what should I do from here?"

};

[endscript]

[return]